      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Agentic autofix for code scanning alerts is now generally available.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-15-agentic-autofix-for-code-scanning-alerts-general-availability",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-15T13:49:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-17T00:23:56.520Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Agentic autofix is available to GitHub Code Security and GitHub Advanced Security customers on GitHub Enterprise Cloud, including GitHub Enterprise Cloud with data residency.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-15-agentic-autofix-for-code-scanning-alerts-general-availability",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-15T13:49:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-17T00:23:56.520Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "When you assign a code scanning alert to Copilot, it:",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-15-agentic-autofix-for-code-scanning-alerts-general-availability",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-15T13:49:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-17T00:23:56.520Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "When enabled, agentic autofix replaces the free Generate Fix option on individual code scanning alerts with an Assign to Copilot button.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-15-agentic-autofix-for-code-scanning-alerts-general-availability",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-15T13:49:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-17T00:23:56.520Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "From any code scanning alert on the repository&rsquo;s default branch, by assigning the alert to Copilot.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-15-agentic-autofix-for-code-scanning-alerts-general-availability",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-15T13:49:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-17T00:23:56.520Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In the list of security alerts in your repository or security campaign, by selecting up to 25 alerts for Copilot to fix together in a single pull request.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-15-agentic-autofix-for-code-scanning-alerts-general-availability",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-15T13:49:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-17T00:23:56.520Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Via the Update a Code Scanning Alert REST API by setting assignees to [\"copilot-swe-agent[bot]\"] .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-15-agentic-autofix-for-code-scanning-alerts-general-availability",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-15T13:49:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-17T00:23:56.520Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Agentic autofix supports code scanning alerts on the repository&rsquo;s default branch.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-15-agentic-autofix-for-code-scanning-alerts-general-availability",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-15T13:49:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-17T00:23:56.520Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Agentic autofix requires an enterprise administrator to enable access to it via the new &ldquo;Agentic autofix&rdquo; policy in Advanced Security policies.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-15-agentic-autofix-for-code-scanning-alerts-general-availability",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-15T13:49:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-17T00:23:56.520Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Once the policy is enabled by an enterprise administrator, an organization or repository administrator can turn on agentic autofix in the Code Security settings for the organization or the repository.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-15-agentic-autofix-for-code-scanning-alerts-general-availability",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-15T13:49:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-17T00:23:56.520Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Agentic autofix for code scanning alerts consumes AI Credits from your Code Security budget and GitHub Actions minutes.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-15-agentic-autofix-for-code-scanning-alerts-general-availability",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-15T13:49:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-17T00:23:56.520Z"
